message: >-
  If you use the analysis software in this repository, please cite this
  software release. The underlying Scopus/SciVal source data are not included.
type: software
title: "NL_MSc_halozat: University of Debrecen publication collaboration networks (2015–2024)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nagy"
    given-names: "Lőrinc"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nlorinc/NL_MSc_halozat"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Python/Jupyter analysis of publication-based co-authorship, faculty, and
  institutional collaboration networks at the University of Debrecen,
  Hungary (2015–2024). The software source code is licensed under MIT.
  Original Scopus/SciVal exports are not redistributed; the accompanying
  SVG figures have separate reuse conditions described in LICENSING.md.
keywords:
